		/magenta? 0 1 0 0 testCMYKColorThrough def
		/yellow? 0 0 1 0 testCMYKColorThrough def
		/black? 0 0 0 1 testCMYKColorThrough def
		grestore
		/isCMYKSep? cyan? magenta? yellow? black? or or or def
